WEBVTT

00:33.700 --> 00:35.035
I don't like Su-jin.

00:37.245 --> 00:38.455
The person I like…

00:40.582 --> 00:41.458
is you.

01:07.525 --> 01:08.818
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:23.917 --> 01:24.876
Ju-kyung.

01:30.799 --> 01:31.966
Why are you running away?

01:34.135 --> 01:36.262
I don't know, it just happened.

01:37.263 --> 01:38.097
But…

01:39.641 --> 01:40.725
it's really me?

01:41.392 --> 01:42.227
Yes.

01:42.727 --> 01:43.603
It's you.

01:44.479 --> 01:45.647
That doesn't make sense.

01:46.689 --> 01:48.691
You're joking, right?

01:48.775 --> 01:50.819
Is this a hidden camera prank?
Is everyone hiding somewhere?

01:50.902 --> 01:52.737
Or are you pity liking me?

01:53.321 --> 01:54.447
Or maybe I'm dreaming?

01:54.531 --> 01:55.406
It's none of those.

01:56.074 --> 01:56.908
Then…

01:58.326 --> 02:00.036
you really like…

02:01.329 --> 02:02.413
Am I not allowed to?

02:10.588 --> 02:11.840
Goodness.

02:13.341 --> 02:15.176
I'm so nervous…

02:15.844 --> 02:18.429
I can't even speak.

02:24.561 --> 02:25.854
I'm nervous too.

02:30.441 --> 02:32.485
I was going to tell you
while giving you this.

02:40.368 --> 02:41.327
Look.

02:42.662 --> 02:44.080
I got all the steps mixed up.

02:56.885 --> 02:58.094
So what about you?

02:59.762 --> 03:00.638
Sorry?

03:06.769 --> 03:10.064
I'm nervous and I have butterflies.
What do you think that means?

03:10.148 --> 03:12.650
- What does it mean?
- It means I really like you.

03:12.734 --> 03:14.444
I like you. I like you a lot.

03:14.527 --> 03:16.779
I dream about you
and I've thought about you all day.

03:16.863 --> 03:19.324
I'm super lazy,
but I've been waking up before my alarm

03:19.407 --> 03:20.575
to go to school early and see you.

03:20.658 --> 03:22.118
And when I see you, my heart…

03:31.002 --> 03:31.878
Anyway,

03:33.963 --> 03:35.632
that's my answer.

03:44.265 --> 03:45.183
Lim Ju-kyung.

03:51.940 --> 03:53.608
I still can't believe it.

03:55.068 --> 03:56.986
I'm not dreaming, am I?

03:59.364 --> 04:01.074
It hurts.

04:07.205 --> 04:08.206
Su-jin!

04:09.749 --> 04:10.583
Who is that?

04:11.251 --> 04:13.461
What do you mean? It's Ju-kyung!

04:22.929 --> 04:24.973
Right, I don't have makeup on.

04:33.231 --> 04:34.190
Ju-kyung.

04:40.905 --> 04:43.157
But why do you
go to such lengths to hide it?

04:45.702 --> 04:46.744
Once…

04:48.037 --> 04:51.040
I asked the kids who bullied me.

04:52.834 --> 04:54.502
About why they hated me so much.

04:56.379 --> 04:59.382
Because you are ugly.

05:00.925 --> 05:02.385
They said it's because I'm ugly.

05:04.929 --> 05:07.849
They simply didn't like my face.

05:09.392 --> 05:11.352
But once I put makeup on,

05:13.229 --> 05:16.190
kids looked at me differently.

05:18.526 --> 05:20.653
They even talk to me first,

05:21.529 --> 05:23.364
and I could make friends easily.

05:26.326 --> 05:27.869
That's when I thought,

05:30.330 --> 05:31.622
I could never

05:32.582 --> 05:35.043
take this mask off.

05:35.877 --> 05:39.797
It must have been difficult for you,
always worrying about people finding out.

05:41.382 --> 05:43.342
If they find out about my bare face,

05:45.261 --> 05:48.097
I'm so scared that they'll curse at me
and turn on me.

05:51.350 --> 05:53.144
I'm really lame, aren't I?

05:57.190 --> 05:59.901
The ones who made you feel this way
are way lamer.

05:59.984 --> 06:02.278
Don't you ever think that way again,
got it?

06:04.989 --> 06:07.241
You said you don't want
the others to find out.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.452
How do we get you inside?

06:13.414 --> 06:14.499
Get up.

06:15.541 --> 06:16.375
What?

06:20.129 --> 06:21.255
Get in.

06:27.428 --> 06:28.304
Let's go.

06:29.097 --> 06:30.431
Let's go!

06:30.515 --> 06:31.974
- We're going in like this?
- Yes.

06:52.203 --> 06:55.414
I really went back and forth
between heaven and hell.

06:58.668 --> 07:01.254
I'm grateful it was Su-jin at any rate.

07:08.136 --> 07:09.011
LEE SOO-HO

07:09.095 --> 07:10.054
Good night.

07:12.807 --> 07:18.104
LIM JU-KYUNG

07:18.187 --> 07:19.397
My finger slipped.

07:30.867 --> 07:31.909
You too.

08:21.959 --> 08:24.170
- What's up with Lee Soo-ho?
- Did he just smile?

08:24.253 --> 08:26.130
I've never seen him smile before.

08:26.214 --> 08:28.132
He's so handsome.

08:32.345 --> 08:33.554
On average…

08:36.807 --> 08:37.683
Throw it away.

08:40.269 --> 08:42.230
Since when do we exchange drinks?

08:42.313 --> 08:43.981
Throw it away. Did you not hear me?

08:48.945 --> 08:49.862
That was rude.

08:49.946 --> 08:50.863
What is it?

08:52.323 --> 08:54.492
Doesn't she know
how expensive strawberries are?

08:54.575 --> 08:55.952
Have you not told her yet?

08:56.536 --> 08:58.454
You're killing me.

09:03.292 --> 09:04.502
Man.

09:06.462 --> 09:08.714
Seo-jun, aren't you going back
to your classroom?

09:08.798 --> 09:11.384
- No, I'm not.
- I see.

09:11.467 --> 09:13.219
Then where should I sit?

09:13.302 --> 09:16.681
- Hurry up and go!
- I don't want to. You go.

09:16.764 --> 09:19.058
Hey, I can't change my class on a whim.

09:19.141 --> 09:20.893
- Come on. Get up.
- Right.

09:20.977 --> 09:23.437
Won't you help me? Come on!

09:24.772 --> 09:25.731
That's right.

09:25.815 --> 09:28.317
Let's go to the sauna
after studying this weekend.

09:28.401 --> 09:29.277
What do you say?

09:30.027 --> 09:30.861
The sauna?

09:31.904 --> 09:33.698
I don't really want to.

09:33.781 --> 09:36.450
Come on, let's go. It'll be fun, right?

09:36.534 --> 09:37.702
Let's go together.

09:37.785 --> 09:39.620
Well, I…

09:42.498 --> 09:45.251
The sauna? No thanks. I hate getting hot.

09:45.334 --> 09:47.503
Fine, then. Jeez.

09:57.680 --> 09:58.639
What's that?

09:59.307 --> 10:00.725
He always eats alone.

10:00.808 --> 10:02.435
Is he close with her?

10:03.978 --> 10:05.771
He's having lunch with Ju-kyung?

10:07.648 --> 10:08.983
There goes my appetite!

10:09.900 --> 10:11.527
Hey, you only had one bite.

10:11.611 --> 10:13.195
Maybe she's on a diet.

10:13.279 --> 10:15.197
That traitor.
She's trying to get even prettier.

10:16.365 --> 10:18.618
She's downright avoiding you, isn't she?

10:18.701 --> 10:21.537
She must know you like her
and is giving you the cold shoulder.

10:23.581 --> 10:26.292
Savior Soo-ho has already been rejected
before he confesses.

10:31.088 --> 10:33.090
Ju-kyung? What happened?

10:33.174 --> 10:34.133
TRULY, YOU'RE SO ANNOYING

10:34.216 --> 10:35.092
"So annoying."

10:35.593 --> 10:37.303
"A butthead."

10:38.596 --> 10:39.930
Poor bastard.

10:41.766 --> 10:43.976
This one is my favorite,
but you can have it.

10:44.560 --> 10:46.854
TRASH INCINERATION AREA

10:50.232 --> 10:52.276
- Gosh, it's Soo-ho.
- He's so tall.

10:52.360 --> 10:54.028
- He's so handsome
- Seriously.

11:01.369 --> 11:02.411
Get down.

11:05.831 --> 11:07.625
Do we really have to do this?

11:07.708 --> 11:09.585
- Of course.
- Why?

11:10.461 --> 11:11.796
What do you mean why?

11:11.879 --> 11:13.422
Haven't you heard?

11:13.506 --> 11:16.926
After you said you liked someone,
even if a girl brushed shoulders with you,

11:17.009 --> 11:19.553
the delinquents who like you
drag them to the rooftop.

11:20.763 --> 11:24.016
If word gets out that I'm dating you…

11:27.186 --> 11:28.270
Hey.

11:32.024 --> 11:33.901
Are you the girl who flirted with Soo-ho?

11:33.984 --> 11:34.819
What?

11:35.694 --> 11:37.571
No. It wasn't me.

11:37.655 --> 11:39.615
Look at her shaking her tail like a fox.

11:42.701 --> 11:44.161
Grab that fox!

11:45.704 --> 11:48.499
No, I didn't flirt with him!

11:54.839 --> 11:56.257
How does that make sense?

11:58.634 --> 12:01.262
- It makes perfect sense.
- So you want to keep this up?

12:01.345 --> 12:02.346
Well,

12:02.430 --> 12:05.057
I'm going to tell Su-jin and Su-ah,
of course.

12:05.724 --> 12:07.977
I just feel a bit shy.

12:11.689 --> 12:13.149
How do I tell them that you're…

12:14.692 --> 12:16.402
my boyfriend?

12:17.445 --> 12:18.654
But I am your boyfriend.

12:19.738 --> 12:20.948
It's weird.

12:21.866 --> 12:24.118
That word doesn't sound right to me.

12:35.045 --> 12:38.174
You know one-on-one counseling
starts next week, right?

12:38.257 --> 12:40.009
- Yes.
- Yes.

12:43.888 --> 12:46.640
CAREER INTEREST SURVEY

13:00.821 --> 13:02.490
It's almost a spy operation.

13:07.286 --> 13:08.579
No one from our school is around, right?

13:10.039 --> 13:12.708
We're an hour away from school.
No one would come here.

13:12.791 --> 13:13.709
But still.

13:15.211 --> 13:16.670
Thank you for coming.

13:18.339 --> 13:20.549
Welcome! Please follow me.

13:20.633 --> 13:22.551
Would you mind a table in an open area?

13:23.135 --> 13:25.429
Somewhere not visible
to security cameras or onlookers.

13:25.513 --> 13:27.056
A secretive, hidden spot, please.

13:28.641 --> 13:29.558
Okay.

13:29.642 --> 13:30.684
Then come this way.

13:31.852 --> 13:34.730
Those young kids are already so demanding.

13:37.399 --> 13:39.902
Please take your time with your menu
and let me know.

13:41.695 --> 13:43.113
Can we get the couple's set?

13:43.739 --> 13:46.200
You know, the menu only for couples?
That one, please.

13:47.034 --> 13:48.160
We're a couple, you see.

13:48.744 --> 13:49.578
All right.

13:50.079 --> 13:51.872
A couple's set? Got it.

13:54.166 --> 13:55.209
A couple.

13:57.503 --> 14:00.631
We can act like a couple
now that no one's around.

14:00.714 --> 14:02.466
You won't even let me
talk to you at school.

14:02.550 --> 14:04.260
It doesn't feel like we're dating.

14:04.343 --> 14:06.011
It feels like we are to me.

14:06.804 --> 14:08.514
It really hit me when I changed this.

14:08.597 --> 14:10.391
What name do you have me saved as?

14:11.058 --> 14:12.476
- In mine--
- Lim Ju-kyung.

14:13.978 --> 14:15.604
- That's my name.
- Yes.

14:16.647 --> 14:18.274
- What about it?
- Well…

14:19.400 --> 14:20.276
My name…

14:22.069 --> 14:23.320
is pretty.

14:23.404 --> 14:26.407
BOYFRIEND

14:29.910 --> 14:31.370
Enjoy.

14:42.256 --> 14:44.925
Do they only give one fork
for a couple's set?

14:45.009 --> 14:46.093
Why is that?

14:50.431 --> 14:51.807
Open up.

14:52.433 --> 14:53.267
You're so cute.

14:54.184 --> 14:55.352
To do that.

15:00.608 --> 15:01.442
Let's eat.

15:02.109 --> 15:02.943
Okay.

15:09.992 --> 15:10.910
Here.

15:17.207 --> 15:19.752
I'm sorry! I forgot your…

15:23.297 --> 15:24.882
Enjoy.

15:38.395 --> 15:39.271
What?

15:39.855 --> 15:41.023
Ju-kyung?

15:42.858 --> 15:43.776
What?

15:43.859 --> 15:45.027
Get down!

15:49.114 --> 15:51.283
Hyun-kyu, what brought you this far out?

15:51.367 --> 15:52.534
This place is famous.

15:52.618 --> 15:54.286
- We come to places like this.
- Right.

15:54.370 --> 15:56.372
What brought you out here and with whom?

15:57.831 --> 15:59.875
I came here alone.

15:59.959 --> 16:01.627
You came here alone

16:01.710 --> 16:03.045
and ordered a couple's set?

16:03.128 --> 16:04.213
It was a decent set.

16:04.296 --> 16:06.548
- She is right about that.
- That's right.

16:06.632 --> 16:08.759
I see.
I guess you can eat more than I thought.

16:08.842 --> 16:09.718
Enjoy your meal.

16:11.136 --> 16:13.013
- Halt.
- No!

16:13.097 --> 16:13.973
Excuse me, sir.

16:14.056 --> 16:15.182
- Hey.
- What?

16:15.265 --> 16:17.643
Let's protect her privacy.

16:17.726 --> 16:19.436
- Okay.
- You're quite the gentleman.

16:19.520 --> 16:22.147
Well, I guess your boyfriend is quite shy?

16:22.231 --> 16:23.482
What do you mean by boyfriend?

16:23.565 --> 16:24.900
Do you want me to lift it up?

16:26.527 --> 16:28.404
It was nice meeting you,
Ju-kyung's boyfriend.

16:28.487 --> 16:31.323
Next time, let's talk face-to-face.

16:33.492 --> 16:36.537
Well, enjoy your date with your boyfriend.

16:36.620 --> 16:38.872
- Go, Ju-kyung!
- Go, Ju-kyung!

16:58.017 --> 16:59.268
Well, that was too close.

16:59.351 --> 17:00.853
An hour away is still dangerous.

17:00.936 --> 17:03.689
We could run into our classmates again,
so I'll be off first.

17:08.444 --> 17:10.529
I brought you here to show you something.

17:11.113 --> 17:12.281
Let's see it, then leave.

17:14.199 --> 17:15.034
Aren't you…

17:16.535 --> 17:17.369
a fan of hers?

17:21.373 --> 17:22.207
It's Selena!

17:24.460 --> 17:25.669
What do I do?

17:29.131 --> 17:32.551
For makeup on acne-prone skin,
you all use high-coverage products, right?

17:32.634 --> 17:33.761
- Yes.
- That's right.

17:33.844 --> 17:37.514
However, gentle products
like this tone-up cream

17:37.598 --> 17:40.017
work much better to cover skin irritation.

17:40.100 --> 17:40.934
Don't forget it.

17:41.018 --> 17:42.561
She's awesome.

17:42.644 --> 17:46.565
Okay, here's a question for you.
I have giveaways, so please pay attention.

17:46.648 --> 17:48.650
While prepping your face
before foundation,

17:48.734 --> 17:52.404
this product can help you apply
the foundation evenly without concealer.

17:52.488 --> 17:54.156
What is this product?

17:54.239 --> 17:55.824
Me!

17:55.908 --> 17:57.993
Over there, you in the brown jacket.

17:58.077 --> 17:58.911
A primer.

18:00.079 --> 18:02.247
A primer? A primer.

18:02.331 --> 18:03.832
That is correct!

18:06.251 --> 18:09.088
The person who got the answer,
come up and claim your prize.

18:10.672 --> 18:12.758
- I'm so jealous.
- What's that?

18:17.262 --> 18:18.514
I got this!

18:26.188 --> 18:27.022
Excuse me…

18:27.523 --> 18:29.983
I'm your biggest fan.

18:30.067 --> 18:31.652
Could I get your autograph?

18:31.735 --> 18:32.903
To remember this by?

18:32.986 --> 18:34.196
Wait a moment. Here it is.

18:34.696 --> 18:38.158
It's a long story,
but you gave me a whole new life.

18:38.242 --> 18:39.618
My friends say I'm good at makeup,

18:39.701 --> 18:41.787
and I learned it all
from watching your videos.

18:42.329 --> 18:43.580
Thank you.

18:47.876 --> 18:49.294
It sucks.

18:50.129 --> 18:50.963
Excuse me?

18:52.297 --> 18:53.382
I said, it sucks.

18:55.050 --> 18:56.885
If you learned makeup from my videos,

18:56.969 --> 18:59.304
how could you pick this shade
for your lips?

19:00.389 --> 19:03.225
Different intensities feel distinct,
even if they're all the same warm tone.

19:04.059 --> 19:07.729
A subtle difference in the shade
can ruin the balance of a whole look.

19:13.485 --> 19:14.903
Here, how does that look?

19:16.446 --> 19:17.990
If you're not going to do it right,

19:19.116 --> 19:20.826
don't say you learned makeup from me.

19:23.328 --> 19:25.998
Thank you. I'll try to do better.

19:29.251 --> 19:31.879
But still, you are doing better
than when I first started.

19:31.962 --> 19:34.423
Don't get discouraged and keep on trying.

19:56.528 --> 19:57.654
Are you that happy?

19:57.738 --> 19:59.448
Yes, I'm so happy.

20:00.866 --> 20:02.701
I couldn't tell the difference.

20:02.784 --> 20:05.829
You did better than her if you asked me.

20:05.913 --> 20:09.625
Hey, I'm nothing compared to Selena.

20:09.708 --> 20:11.543
I couldn't be like her even if I tried.

20:12.294 --> 20:13.253
Why not?

20:13.879 --> 20:16.048
She wasn't an expert
when she first started out.

20:17.257 --> 20:19.968
But still, you are doing better
than when I first started.

20:20.469 --> 20:21.303
Come on.

20:22.054 --> 20:23.138
Still.

20:25.515 --> 20:28.060
I guess you liked seeing Selena
more than our first date.

20:28.894 --> 20:29.770
What?

20:31.521 --> 20:32.356
Nothing.

20:35.651 --> 20:36.693
You haven't closed yet.

20:36.777 --> 20:39.404
- Did you have customers this late?
- Hey, Ju-kyung!

20:39.488 --> 20:41.406
Why are you roaming about so late?

20:41.490 --> 20:43.242
Did you have dinner yet, Ju-kyung?

20:43.325 --> 20:44.826
I did have dinner.

20:44.910 --> 20:46.245
Guess who I saw today?

20:46.328 --> 20:47.329
I saw Selena!

20:47.412 --> 20:48.580
Selena? Who's that?

20:48.664 --> 20:51.750
- She's a famous makeup artist--
- The one who does makeup for celebrities?

20:51.833 --> 20:53.627
She has a tough job just like me.

20:56.171 --> 20:58.924
There's no money coming in,
but always money going out.

20:59.007 --> 21:02.094
Taking care of a family of five
is incredibly difficult.

21:02.177 --> 21:04.429
If only we still had our apartment.

21:07.557 --> 21:09.434
Is business not doing well lately?

21:09.518 --> 21:11.186
It's not like how it used to be.

21:11.979 --> 21:15.232
I need to make it work
until you all graduate college.

21:17.109 --> 21:18.193
I'll get going then.

21:18.277 --> 21:19.486
Hey!

21:19.569 --> 21:21.780
Take this out on your way out.

21:22.572 --> 21:23.615
It stinks.

21:24.616 --> 21:26.994
And do the dishes when you get home.

21:27.077 --> 21:28.996
COLUMBUS PARK SPOTTED

21:29.079 --> 21:30.872
We'll get fruit flies otherwise.

21:30.956 --> 21:33.208
Ju-young is at home.
You should have asked him.

21:36.920 --> 21:39.172
I've always wanted this.

21:46.888 --> 21:48.181
It's so soft.

21:52.394 --> 21:55.147
CAREER INTEREST SURVEY

21:56.523 --> 21:58.525
So what if I have an interest?

21:58.608 --> 22:01.403
It's not as if my interest
will get me there.

22:01.987 --> 22:03.405
Which college should I choose?

22:21.256 --> 22:23.550
MAKEUP ARTIST LICENSE COURSE
1.5 MILLION WON PER MONTH

22:24.217 --> 22:25.177
1.5 million won?

22:25.927 --> 22:28.221
It's too expensive to even dream about it.

22:34.394 --> 22:36.104
What's going on? Did you drink again?

22:36.188 --> 22:37.022
No.

22:37.522 --> 22:38.982
Alcohol…

22:39.608 --> 22:41.318
drank me.

22:42.944 --> 22:44.863
What's going on with her lately?

22:45.489 --> 22:47.699
- Take off your shoes first.
- Throw them out.

22:48.575 --> 22:49.618
Hello?

22:49.701 --> 22:50.702
Hee-kyung.

22:51.411 --> 22:53.705
Where are you?
I couldn't reach you at all.

22:53.789 --> 22:56.750
My sister is asleep right now.
By the way, who is this?

22:56.833 --> 22:57.667
I…

22:58.168 --> 22:59.878
was her subordinate in the military.

23:01.129 --> 23:02.756
Have a good night.

23:02.839 --> 23:05.133
Salute!

23:07.552 --> 23:09.930
- A subordinate in the military?
- Salute.

23:11.473 --> 23:13.725
That voice sounded very familiar.

23:45.298 --> 23:46.508
I have a headache.

23:46.591 --> 23:48.051
Dad, where's my uniform?

23:48.135 --> 23:50.804
- Here it is.
- Honey, get me some water.

23:50.887 --> 23:52.055
Dad!

23:52.139 --> 23:54.558
- Honey?
- I'm hungry.

23:54.641 --> 23:56.184
Hey, have you guys seen your dad?

23:56.268 --> 23:57.144
No.

23:57.227 --> 23:59.521
Gosh, where did he go
early in the morning?

24:00.230 --> 24:01.273
What's this?

24:02.566 --> 24:03.984
TO MY DEAR FAMILY

24:04.067 --> 24:05.443
I can't believe this!

24:06.153 --> 24:07.154
- What is it?
- What?

24:07.237 --> 24:10.115
To my dear family, Hyun-sook, kids,

24:10.198 --> 24:13.952
I'm heading to Jeju Island
to catch Columbus Park.

24:14.035 --> 24:16.580
I won't be heading back home

24:16.663 --> 24:19.166
until I get him and my money back.

24:19.249 --> 24:21.710
But don't you worry about me.

24:21.793 --> 24:23.879
This is absolutely ridiculous!

24:29.342 --> 24:30.635
Someone's enjoying her life.

24:37.434 --> 24:40.812
Hey, wake up. The bus will be here soon.

25:00.498 --> 25:02.500
Hey, Seo-jun.

25:02.584 --> 25:05.337
Hey, do you fall asleep
just about anywhere?

25:06.046 --> 25:07.839
You wouldn't know if you got kidnapped.

25:08.965 --> 25:11.092
I'm heavy so that won't be possible.

25:14.262 --> 25:15.597
I'm sorry about that.

25:16.973 --> 25:18.016
Seriously?

25:19.267 --> 25:20.894
I should have ignored you and left.

25:20.977 --> 25:22.229
What am I doing, seriously?

25:22.729 --> 25:23.563
What?

25:25.273 --> 25:27.567
I see you're not riding
your motorcycle these days.

25:27.651 --> 25:29.736
Is it because I told you not to?

25:30.862 --> 25:31.738
What?

25:38.870 --> 25:42.374
You should listen to your mother.

25:42.457 --> 25:43.708
I'm sorry,

25:43.792 --> 25:45.669
but I have a soft spot for a sick person,

25:45.752 --> 25:47.379
so I have to take her side on this.

25:48.505 --> 25:50.715
Hey, your mom's worried sick about it.

25:50.799 --> 25:52.592
So why risk it and ride the motorcycle?

26:03.353 --> 26:04.187
Do you think

26:05.063 --> 26:06.940
I'm one to simply follow your orders?

26:07.023 --> 26:09.234
I'm a very good son, you know.

26:09.317 --> 26:11.569
I'm not riding it
since my mom told me not to.

26:12.570 --> 26:14.281
The bus will arrive shortly.

26:14.364 --> 26:16.157
The bus is here. Where are you going?

26:17.200 --> 26:19.577
I'm going to run to school
to get some exercise. Why?

26:20.078 --> 26:20.912
See you later.

26:25.375 --> 26:26.334
What was that?

26:27.210 --> 26:29.212
Gosh. What am I doing, really?

26:30.046 --> 26:32.424
I'm sorry.
I won't be able to see you this evening.

26:35.802 --> 26:37.137
Is something going on?

26:37.721 --> 26:40.473
Mr. Han, if you're free this evening,

26:40.557 --> 26:43.268
will you help me choose
a birthday present for the vice principal?

26:43.351 --> 26:44.269
Excuse me?

26:44.352 --> 26:46.313
I'm supposed to get it,

26:46.396 --> 26:49.107
but I'm not sure what to get for a man.

26:49.190 --> 26:51.985
Well, I'm no expert
in choosing gifts either.

26:52.068 --> 26:53.278
I can accompany you.

26:53.361 --> 26:56.656
I have to go to the department store
to get a present for my wife anyway.

26:58.074 --> 26:59.117
Yes, hello?

27:00.535 --> 27:03.455
Well then, Mr. Han. I'll see you later.

27:03.538 --> 27:04.706
But…

27:14.632 --> 27:15.675
Hey, Ju-kyung's here.

27:17.344 --> 27:18.928
Limju, you have a boyfriend now?

27:19.012 --> 27:21.473
How come you didn't tell me?
What school does he go to?

27:21.556 --> 27:23.808
He's not in our school, is he? Tell me.

27:23.892 --> 27:24.809
Who told you that?

27:27.937 --> 27:30.357
I saw them at the K-Mall.

27:30.440 --> 27:32.984
She hid him because
she didn't want us to see him.

27:33.068 --> 27:35.487
Hey, I told you it wasn't like that.

27:35.570 --> 27:38.365
Hey, why are you being so shy?
You got a boyfriend.

27:38.448 --> 27:39.407
- So what?
- He's right.

27:39.491 --> 27:40.992
You're overreacting too.

27:41.076 --> 27:43.912
- Are you dating a celebrity or something?
- "A celebrity."

27:43.995 --> 27:45.872
- Is she, though?
- Really?

27:49.918 --> 27:52.087
Tell me. Who is it?
So you got a boyfriend?

27:52.170 --> 27:53.380
No, it's not like that.

27:53.463 --> 27:55.048
Then what are they talking about?

27:55.131 --> 27:55.965
Man.

27:56.633 --> 28:00.929
I told you to tell her how you feel,
you dum-dum!

28:06.643 --> 28:08.269
What to do now?

28:08.353 --> 28:09.562
What's wrong with you?

28:09.646 --> 28:10.855
Don't act up, okay?

28:10.939 --> 28:11.940
Hey!

28:13.316 --> 28:14.776
Go back to your seats.

28:15.527 --> 28:16.528
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

28:24.702 --> 28:25.537
LIM JU-KYUNG

28:25.620 --> 28:26.996
Want to go to Prince Comics later?

28:27.080 --> 28:27.914
BOYFRIEND

28:27.997 --> 28:30.125
Sure.
Let's get instant noodles with egg too.

28:30.917 --> 28:33.211
I forgot to ask. Send me the picture.

28:33.294 --> 28:34.379
What picture?

28:34.462 --> 28:37.424
The picture we took on the boat together.

28:44.222 --> 28:46.474
AHN HYUN-KYU

28:56.192 --> 28:57.652
BOYFRIEND

28:57.736 --> 28:59.362
Why aren't you sending me the photo?

28:59.446 --> 29:02.240
AHN HYUN-KYU

29:03.116 --> 29:04.534
Ahn Hyun-kyu?

29:07.203 --> 29:09.122
Darn it. Why him?

29:14.002 --> 29:15.670
Hey, don't fall off.

29:21.843 --> 29:23.428
UNREAD

29:24.095 --> 29:25.513
He hasn't read it yet.

29:26.598 --> 29:27.682
All right.

29:27.766 --> 29:29.559
I just have to get rid of the evidence.

29:30.185 --> 29:31.436
I can do it.

29:34.105 --> 29:36.191
- Move forward!
- Just do it quickly!

29:43.823 --> 29:44.991
Hey, Ju-kyung!

29:46.451 --> 29:47.368
I'm sorry.

29:49.162 --> 29:50.997
Hey, I told you not to do it like that!

29:51.080 --> 29:53.708
- You should have done it right!
- You don't even make sense!

29:53.792 --> 29:55.794
- Man, seriously.
- It's not my fault!

30:03.092 --> 30:04.469
USE FINGERPRINT OR ENTER PIN

30:05.804 --> 30:09.849
Okay, your Korean History teacher's here!

30:12.977 --> 30:13.812
All right,

30:14.604 --> 30:15.480
have a seat.

30:15.563 --> 30:18.191
The Japanese Invasion of Korea in 1592,
the Imjin War.

30:18.274 --> 30:19.943
What's a good way to memorize this?

30:20.026 --> 30:22.695
I need to delete it
before he notices his phone's missing.

30:22.779 --> 30:25.156
That should do the trick, right?

30:25.240 --> 30:26.366
Fingerprint.

30:27.033 --> 30:27.867
Fingerprint.

30:27.951 --> 30:29.661
How do I get his fingerprint?

30:29.744 --> 30:31.371
…the politics of that era…

30:32.580 --> 30:35.124
Is Su-ah taking a class
on the science of sleep?

30:35.208 --> 30:36.751
She wouldn't wake
even if someone took her.

30:36.835 --> 30:38.419
- Cute.
- Seriously, 1592…

30:38.503 --> 30:39.337
That's it.

30:40.004 --> 30:40.839
Fall asleep.

30:41.506 --> 30:43.049
The rest of you, focus up.

30:43.132 --> 30:44.300
Fall asleep.

30:45.051 --> 30:47.303
So you won't know what hits you.

30:49.138 --> 30:50.598
Why is he suddenly studying so hard?

30:51.516 --> 30:52.684
Come on, fall asleep.

31:04.696 --> 31:05.572
What is she doing?

31:10.034 --> 31:13.162
All right, you're falling asleep.

31:14.789 --> 31:16.541
Falling asleep.

31:17.917 --> 31:21.379
Falling asleep.

31:22.630 --> 31:24.132
Red Sun!

31:26.134 --> 31:28.720
Mark down the things
I said were important.

31:28.803 --> 31:29.971
Awesome.

31:30.054 --> 31:32.640
Okay, that's it for today.
I'll see you next time!

31:47.488 --> 31:49.407
LIM JU-KYUNG

31:49.490 --> 31:51.242
- What? Why do you have my phone?
- What?

31:51.326 --> 31:52.660
I said why do you--

31:53.411 --> 31:54.746
What is this about?

31:57.749 --> 31:59.083
It's nothing.

32:01.669 --> 32:02.879
Excuse me.

32:06.758 --> 32:08.301
Seriously, what's up with her?

32:18.770 --> 32:19.896
Gosh.

32:19.979 --> 32:22.565
If Hyun-kyu found out about us,
the whole school…

32:22.649 --> 32:25.485
No, even people from other schools
would know of it by now.

32:26.527 --> 32:28.780
The rumors about the rooftop
must have really shaken you.

32:28.863 --> 32:30.239
That too, but…

32:32.992 --> 32:36.663
I'm afraid of people talking smack
when they learn of our relationship.

32:37.372 --> 32:40.124
They'd wonder why a guy like you
would date a girl like me.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.418
And what's wrong with you?

32:44.379 --> 32:45.505
It's obvious.

32:47.131 --> 32:48.591
I'm neither pretty

32:49.092 --> 32:50.301
nor smart.

32:51.594 --> 32:53.721
You are way out of my league.

32:56.349 --> 32:57.308
You're enough.

32:59.102 --> 33:00.645
You're enough just the way you are.

33:03.022 --> 33:04.482
So don't say things like that.

33:15.159 --> 33:17.996
PRINCE COMICS

33:19.080 --> 33:22.500
At least this place
is free of our schoolmates.

33:23.251 --> 33:25.753
- Want to meet up here from now on?
- Sure.

33:37.598 --> 33:38.599
What is it?

33:46.024 --> 33:48.359
Look who's here! Go-un!

33:48.443 --> 33:49.944
Ju-kyung!

33:57.243 --> 33:59.162
This place won't work either.

33:59.662 --> 34:01.205
I'll call you later.

34:08.212 --> 34:10.506
- Get home safe!
- Okay.

34:27.899 --> 34:30.276
It's probably too young for him.

34:30.359 --> 34:31.360
Should we exchange it?

34:32.278 --> 34:34.781
They all look pretty similar to me.

34:37.742 --> 34:39.243
Will you get up, please?

34:39.327 --> 34:40.578
How did you…

34:47.835 --> 34:49.378
Do you know this person?

34:49.921 --> 34:50.922
Who…

34:51.589 --> 34:53.299
- I'm Lim Hee-kyung.
- Right.

34:53.382 --> 34:54.425
And who are you?

34:56.719 --> 34:58.971
- I'm Lee Hye-lim.
- Indeed.

34:59.055 --> 35:00.306
I'm his colleague.

35:00.389 --> 35:01.307
For now.

35:01.390 --> 35:03.142
Is that going to change in the future?

35:03.684 --> 35:07.105
I guess colleagues these days
are quite intimate.

35:07.188 --> 35:09.774
You meet outside of work
and fix his ties and stuff?

35:09.857 --> 35:11.609
No. Not at all.

35:13.152 --> 35:13.986
You've misread--

35:14.070 --> 35:16.614
What's your relationship
with Mr. Han, then?

35:16.697 --> 35:17.949
- Well…
- His girlfriend.

35:18.032 --> 35:20.159
- Excuse me?
- What?

35:22.495 --> 35:23.621
We're seeing each other.

35:27.125 --> 35:29.001
- My ears aren't working…
- His girlfriend!

35:30.545 --> 35:32.505
- Let's talk outside.
- I can't hear well.

35:33.840 --> 35:36.384
We're dating! This guy is my man!

35:36.467 --> 35:37.468
Can't you hear at all?

35:38.052 --> 35:39.637
Jeez, what kind of…

35:39.720 --> 35:40.805
Goodness.

35:41.514 --> 35:43.516
You're Mr. Han's girlfriend?

35:43.599 --> 35:45.143
So nice to meet you!

35:45.935 --> 35:47.979
- Nice to meet you too.
- Sir, I'm sorry.

35:48.062 --> 35:49.313
I'm going to head home.

35:49.397 --> 35:50.356
But why?

35:50.439 --> 35:52.108
I'm sorry. Excuse me.

35:54.485 --> 35:55.570
What is it?

35:57.029 --> 35:57.989
Jun-woo.

36:04.745 --> 36:05.872
It's…

36:13.129 --> 36:15.673
CAREER INTEREST SURVEY

36:19.427 --> 36:21.554
HANKOOK UNIVERSITY COSMETOLOGY

36:28.811 --> 36:30.855
What's with her?
Why is she sleeping all day?

36:30.938 --> 36:32.732
She was up late
looking for a part-time job.

36:32.815 --> 36:34.942
What? A part-time job?

36:35.902 --> 36:37.778
She must have been really tired.

36:47.705 --> 36:50.291
Hey, you dropped this.

36:58.216 --> 36:59.258
Right, Kangsu.

36:59.342 --> 37:00.718
Want to stop by the snack bar?

37:02.970 --> 37:03.971
Kangsu!

37:17.902 --> 37:19.737
Guys should hold girls like that.

37:19.820 --> 37:21.656
Isn't that Soo-ho's?
Then I'll give it to him.

37:22.865 --> 37:23.783
Have you seen Ju-kyung?

37:24.367 --> 37:26.202
Ju-kyung asked me to bring this to you.

37:26.285 --> 37:27.578
She asked you?

37:37.797 --> 37:39.799
RESUME

37:40.591 --> 37:42.843
- Is this your first job?
- Yes.

37:42.927 --> 37:46.597
- I'm looking for someone with experience.
- I'll work hard if you train me.

37:46.681 --> 37:48.432
Plenty of people can work hard.

37:48.516 --> 37:49.350
The thing is,

37:49.433 --> 37:51.102
I need someone who'll do well.

37:51.185 --> 37:52.603
- I'm sorry.
- Well…

37:54.146 --> 37:55.273
I understand.

37:56.065 --> 37:58.567
I'm sorry. We already have a part-timer.

37:59.694 --> 38:02.780
I guess it's not easy
to get a part-time job either.

38:05.283 --> 38:08.160
BOYFRIEND

38:11.122 --> 38:14.292
The person you are trying to reach
is unavailable…

38:14.375 --> 38:15.835
Is he very busy?

38:27.805 --> 38:29.890
A pervert!

38:31.267 --> 38:32.101
What the heck?

38:34.729 --> 38:36.147
- Seo-jun?
- What's this?

38:36.856 --> 38:37.982
What are you doing here?

38:38.649 --> 38:39.692
The same goes for you.

38:39.775 --> 38:42.611
Why are you taking your clothes off
in the women's restroom?

38:45.197 --> 38:46.198
Damn it!

38:54.915 --> 38:56.709
You totally look like a model.

38:57.668 --> 38:59.503
Are you doing a photo shoot?

38:59.587 --> 39:00.421
Yes.

39:00.921 --> 39:01.756
Bye.

39:02.298 --> 39:03.966
What? Really?

39:04.550 --> 39:05.760
Hey, Seo-jun!

39:11.265 --> 39:12.433
A billion won?

39:13.517 --> 39:15.353
Mr. Lee donated big this year.

39:15.436 --> 39:18.272
That's why the hospital director
brought in the press

39:18.356 --> 39:21.108
and made a big deal out of
giving him an appreciation plaque.

39:22.109 --> 39:25.696
One might think that Lee Ju-hun
founded our hospital's cancer center.

39:28.157 --> 39:30.034
- Hello!
- We kept you waiting, haven't we?

39:30.618 --> 39:31.952
- I'm sorry.
- There's no need.

39:32.036 --> 39:33.788
I invited you when you must be busy.

39:35.498 --> 39:37.500
Soo-ho, it's been a while, right?

39:37.583 --> 39:38.959
Hello, how have you been?

39:40.169 --> 39:41.837
Okay, that was great just now. Edgy.

39:41.921 --> 39:43.381
Now turn. Just once, that's it.

39:43.464 --> 39:45.633
I'm moving in closer.
You look great. One, two.

39:45.716 --> 39:48.052
Hey, the last two shots.
One, two, two, three.

39:48.135 --> 39:49.804
Three, two… Okay.

39:49.887 --> 39:51.972
It's perfect, Seo-jun.
Smile a bit more. One, two.

39:52.056 --> 39:53.557
Look down. Here.

39:54.558 --> 39:56.060
Okay. One, two.

39:56.143 --> 39:57.770
Three, two. Right, just like that.

39:57.853 --> 39:59.105
Go, one, two.

39:59.188 --> 40:01.315
Okay! We got it.

40:01.399 --> 40:03.025
Seo-jun, let's get you changed.

40:03.526 --> 40:04.485
Great job.

40:07.029 --> 40:08.572
What? You're still here?

40:08.656 --> 40:10.825
Yes. It was exciting,
so I stayed and watched.

40:10.908 --> 40:14.328
- Hold on. Are you Seo-jun's girlfriend?
- No, she's not.

40:14.412 --> 40:15.579
- Hello.
- Hi.

40:16.247 --> 40:17.832
If you have such a pretty friend…

40:17.915 --> 40:19.166
Pretty, my foot.

40:20.292 --> 40:22.962
- Hurry up and leave.
- Jeez. All right.

40:23.045 --> 40:24.046
Wait.

40:24.797 --> 40:26.966
What's your problem, kicking her out?

40:27.842 --> 40:29.468
Excuse me, Seo-jun's friend?

40:30.678 --> 40:32.221
Do you want to model for the day?

40:32.930 --> 40:36.934
Actually, our female model didn't show up,
so I was in trouble.

40:38.394 --> 40:40.187
- Me?
- Hey.

40:40.271 --> 40:41.939
Can anyone be a model now?

40:42.773 --> 40:44.400
I told you to leave!

40:46.652 --> 40:50.239
We desperately need a model
to update our new items in time.

40:50.322 --> 40:51.699
So, would you like to try it?

40:51.782 --> 40:52.616
Well…

40:52.700 --> 40:54.827
But I've never done
anything like this before…

40:54.910 --> 40:56.704
You might do better
because you're a blank slate.

40:56.787 --> 40:59.790
And since you're his friend,
I'll give you a better pay.

41:00.541 --> 41:01.500
There's payment?

41:01.584 --> 41:02.710
Then I want to try it!

41:02.793 --> 41:04.420
- Hey!
- Awesome.

41:06.088 --> 41:08.132
I heard you two are
in the same class this year.

41:09.383 --> 41:13.179
I hope you take good care of him, Su-jin.

41:13.762 --> 41:16.640
I keep telling him to move in with me,
but he won't listen.

41:17.141 --> 41:19.393
Since we live apart,
looking after him isn't easy.

41:19.477 --> 41:20.811
I will.

41:20.895 --> 41:23.147
I can manage on my own
without a caretaker.

41:23.230 --> 41:24.231
Don't you worry.

41:24.899 --> 41:26.066
By the way,

41:26.150 --> 41:29.653
Soo-ho looks more like you
with each passing day.

41:29.737 --> 41:31.322
Have you thought about making him a star?

41:31.405 --> 41:34.408
His grades are too good
for him to just be a celebrity.

41:34.492 --> 41:35.493
Is that right?

41:35.576 --> 41:37.828
As long as it's something Soo-ho likes,

41:37.912 --> 41:39.497
I'll support whatever he chooses.

41:39.580 --> 41:41.999
You can say that
since he does well on his own.

41:42.666 --> 41:44.877
If I don't hold the reins for Su-jin,

41:44.960 --> 41:46.879
she'll lose her senses and hit the bottom.

41:47.505 --> 41:49.131
Compared to boys,

41:49.215 --> 41:51.800
she lacks patience
and isn't as competitive.

41:52.468 --> 41:54.470
That's why she always falls behind Soo-ho.

41:55.095 --> 41:57.389
Your innate smarts do factor in, but…

41:57.473 --> 41:58.682
We have a study session.

42:02.269 --> 42:04.230
- You're leaving already?
- Yes, excuse us.

42:06.023 --> 42:06.857
Let's go.

42:09.235 --> 42:10.194
Goodbye.

42:10.778 --> 42:11.654
Take care.

42:15.115 --> 42:17.034
That's a little awkward.
No, don't do that.

42:17.117 --> 42:18.285
Don't point at things.

42:18.369 --> 42:20.037
Try acting natural, okay?

42:20.120 --> 42:21.038
All right, one, two.

42:21.121 --> 42:22.373
No, that's not it either.

42:22.456 --> 42:24.542
- Try something natural.
- Something like this?

42:24.625 --> 42:26.168
Out of the question. One, two.

42:26.252 --> 42:27.336
No. Don't do that.

42:27.419 --> 42:28.879
- Not the hair--
- Come on!

42:28.963 --> 42:30.464
You're keeping her when she's this bad?

42:30.548 --> 42:34.134
I haven't taken very many photos.
I'm so sorry.

42:34.218 --> 42:35.469
That's only natural for a newbie.

42:35.553 --> 42:37.137
He was the same. Right, Seo-jun?

42:37.221 --> 42:39.807
Seo-jun, can you get close to her
and get things moving?

42:40.975 --> 42:42.726
Act like you are really close, okay?

42:42.810 --> 42:45.437
Okay, let's go! All right.
One, two, three.

42:45.521 --> 42:47.439
That's it. Arms around his shoulders.

42:47.523 --> 42:48.899
Okay, Seo-jun, smile. Go on.

42:48.983 --> 42:51.777
We just need you to smile, Seo-jun.
Come on.

42:51.860 --> 42:54.405
Hey, Han Seo-jun!
Why are you acting like an amateur?

42:54.488 --> 42:56.073
It's not your first couple shoot.

42:56.156 --> 42:57.616
Let's just stop, then.

42:57.700 --> 42:59.952
It must be your empty stomach talking.

43:00.661 --> 43:02.621
I'll get you something nice.
Let's take ten.

43:02.705 --> 43:04.039
Let's take ten, guys.

43:04.123 --> 43:04.957
Sure.

43:08.085 --> 43:10.421
- I'm really bad, aren't I?
- No.

43:10.504 --> 43:11.797
You're awful beyond imagination.

43:12.381 --> 43:14.675
So tell him you can't do it and leave.

43:15.551 --> 43:18.762
Are you being territorial? That's petty.
You should help me out.

43:19.722 --> 43:20.848
I don't want to.

43:23.100 --> 43:25.477
Is it because of the lights?
It's really hot in here.

43:30.107 --> 43:32.359
- What are you doing?
- What?

43:32.443 --> 43:34.612
I can't ruin a new dress.

43:35.571 --> 43:37.615
- It's so hot.
- Jeez.

43:41.076 --> 43:42.328
My face is too shiny.

43:48.876 --> 43:50.377
Want me to dab your face?

43:54.882 --> 43:55.799
What are you doing?

43:55.883 --> 43:57.968
You've got some sweat on you too.

43:58.719 --> 44:00.804
No thanks. Go sit over there.

44:00.888 --> 44:03.766
Why not? I'm trying to
make you look good in the pictures.

44:05.267 --> 44:06.393
I said, don't.

44:09.813 --> 44:11.148
Does this come easy to you?

44:12.566 --> 44:13.484
What does?

44:24.161 --> 44:25.412
I'm a man too.

44:28.582 --> 44:30.459
You're certainly a man and not a woman.

44:33.671 --> 44:34.505
What's this?

44:34.588 --> 44:36.674
That's what I wanted. Where's my camera?

44:36.757 --> 44:37.633
Okay, great.

44:37.716 --> 44:40.219
Let's go. Look this way.
Just like that, one, two.

44:44.473 --> 44:46.183
Cooperate so we can wrap it up quickly.

45:25.848 --> 45:27.433
You really are just reading.

45:27.516 --> 45:29.351
Wasn't the study session just an excuse?

45:29.435 --> 45:30.394
No, it wasn't.

45:30.978 --> 45:34.398
But still, thank you.
My food wasn't going down back there.

45:35.399 --> 45:37.734
Are you really
not moving in with your dad?

45:37.818 --> 45:39.653
It sounded like he really wants you to.

45:39.736 --> 45:42.739
We've lived apart for longer.
It'll only make things awkward.

45:43.657 --> 45:45.033
It's comfortable right now.

45:45.117 --> 45:45.951
Yours and mine…

45:46.827 --> 45:48.162
What's wrong with our dads?

45:48.245 --> 45:49.204
By the way,

45:50.164 --> 45:51.790
nothing has happened since then?

45:52.374 --> 45:55.377
- Did you get slapped--
- No, nothing happened.

45:55.461 --> 45:57.754
Things will be calm
until the next report card.

45:58.422 --> 46:00.841
Anyway, what gives?
You're worried about me?

46:01.675 --> 46:02.593
What do you mean?

46:02.676 --> 46:06.305
You've been talking more lately
as if you've regained some humanity.

46:06.388 --> 46:07.306
Whatever.

46:11.935 --> 46:14.146
MISSED CALL LIM JU-KYUNG

46:14.229 --> 46:15.355
I missed a call.

46:18.150 --> 46:19.776
BOYFRIEND

46:19.860 --> 46:22.279
It's on me since it was
thanks to you I got paid.

46:22.863 --> 46:25.782
- Why are you getting a part-time job?
- To pay for beauty school.

46:25.866 --> 46:26.950
Beauty school?

46:27.034 --> 46:29.203
While filling out
my career interest survey,

46:29.286 --> 46:31.997
I thought about what I found interesting,

46:32.080 --> 46:34.541
and makeup came to my mind.

46:34.625 --> 46:37.836
My heart fluttered
when I did stage makeup for Go-un.

46:38.962 --> 46:39.880
My sister

46:39.963 --> 46:41.882
did look like a different person.

46:41.965 --> 46:43.550
- Here's your tteokbokki.
- It's here!

46:54.228 --> 46:55.062
Anyway,

46:56.104 --> 46:57.981
you've had many girlfriends, haven't you?

46:58.899 --> 46:59.733
Why do you ask?

46:59.816 --> 47:01.652
What did you save her as in your phone?

47:01.735 --> 47:04.029
Do guys not put much meaning into this?

47:05.697 --> 47:06.657
Yes, they do.

47:06.740 --> 47:09.868
I save my girlfriend's number
under something super sweet,

47:09.952 --> 47:11.411
like my love, baby, or princess.

47:11.495 --> 47:12.329
With hearts.

47:14.039 --> 47:15.332
I see.

47:16.500 --> 47:19.294
Right, I told you on our school trip…

47:19.378 --> 47:21.421
I don't care. Don't tell me.

47:21.505 --> 47:23.090
I'm dating Soo-ho.

47:23.757 --> 47:26.260
You really don't listen.
I said, don't tell me.

47:26.343 --> 47:27.511
I don't want to either.

47:27.594 --> 47:30.013
But after crying about liking him
in front of you,

47:30.097 --> 47:32.891
- how could I not say anything?
- I'm not congratulating you.

47:35.477 --> 47:37.354
You're eating well.
Should I order one more?

47:37.437 --> 47:38.438
Don't bother!

47:40.274 --> 47:41.692
The others didn't seem to know.

47:42.693 --> 47:43.694
Is this also a secret?

47:43.777 --> 47:46.196
Yes, I think it'd be best for now.

47:46.863 --> 47:48.448
And Soo-ho easily agreed to that?

47:49.074 --> 47:49.908
Why do you ask?

47:50.492 --> 47:52.077
If I had a girlfriend,

47:52.160 --> 47:55.080
I'd want to show her off
and tell everyone.

47:56.331 --> 47:57.708
That's how I'd feel, at least.

48:01.461 --> 48:02.754
Get down.

48:02.838 --> 48:04.381
Do we really have to do this?

48:05.716 --> 48:07.217
I wonder if I hurt his feelings.

48:10.929 --> 48:12.806
- Is it spicy?
- No.

48:12.889 --> 48:15.058
It's perfect. I love it.

48:16.059 --> 48:17.311
Are you going home now?

48:18.312 --> 48:20.188
Look! Those kids go to our middle school.

48:21.815 --> 48:22.649
I see.

48:27.279 --> 48:28.947
I think you've gotten taller.

48:29.031 --> 48:31.325
You used to be shorter than me
and would get beaten up.

48:31.408 --> 48:32.576
When did you get so tall?

48:32.659 --> 48:34.578
Still talking about our kindergarten days?

48:43.295 --> 48:45.380
- Get home safe.
- Okay.

48:54.723 --> 48:56.099
- I'll walk you home.
- Hello?

48:56.683 --> 48:57.517
See you tomorrow.

48:58.268 --> 48:59.936
We keep missing each other's calls.

49:01.188 --> 49:02.439
I have heartburn.

49:03.357 --> 49:06.693
Why did I shove all that in
when I can't even eat spicy food?

49:08.028 --> 49:08.862
Eat.

49:11.031 --> 49:11.865
Here.

49:20.207 --> 49:21.541
What did you do today?

49:21.625 --> 49:24.211
I interviewed for part-time jobs,
but I didn't get any of them.

49:32.177 --> 49:34.554
Anyway, I made some money
for the first time ever.

49:34.638 --> 49:35.972
I ran into Seo-jun somehow--

49:36.056 --> 49:36.932
Sir?

49:38.433 --> 49:39.518
Soo-ho?

49:41.895 --> 49:42.729
"Sir"?

49:43.689 --> 49:44.523
Who do you mean?

49:45.440 --> 49:46.274
Just now…

49:46.942 --> 49:48.026
I saw your…

49:53.281 --> 49:54.282
You can't.

49:57.577 --> 50:00.205
How can a person scam others
in a scam victims' group?

50:00.288 --> 50:02.582
They asked us to go catch him as a group.

50:02.666 --> 50:05.794
Then they ran off
with our flight and lodging fees.

50:07.087 --> 50:09.005
They were very clever and organized.

50:10.507 --> 50:12.718
It sounds like you fell for a sloppy scam.

50:12.801 --> 50:14.302
No, they were…

50:14.386 --> 50:15.846
Gosh. Whatever.

50:16.888 --> 50:20.267
I talked big to my family
about how I won't return until I got him,

50:20.350 --> 50:21.309
so how can I go back?

50:21.393 --> 50:25.522
That's why you should
keep this a secret from Ju-kyung, okay?

50:26.440 --> 50:28.191
She must be worried, so how could I?

50:28.275 --> 50:30.277
- Let's just call her right--
- No, never!

50:30.777 --> 50:31.945
If you tell her now,

50:32.529 --> 50:34.322
I'll run away and never return.

50:34.406 --> 50:37.576
Then what is your plan?
You said you're out of money now.

50:39.202 --> 50:43.290
I'd rather freeze to death
sleeping on this cold floor

50:44.166 --> 50:45.417
than go back home.

50:46.668 --> 50:47.669
Not to mine, at least.

50:48.503 --> 50:49.337
Okay.

50:49.963 --> 50:50.797
What?

50:51.298 --> 50:52.674
Well then, good night.

50:53.258 --> 50:54.760
- What?
- I'll get going.

50:54.843 --> 50:56.303
Soo-ho. Wait a moment.

50:58.221 --> 51:01.308
- Your name means savior.
- That's right.

51:01.391 --> 51:03.810
You have some saving to do.

51:03.894 --> 51:05.395
Hey, Soo-ho, wait up.

51:11.693 --> 51:13.987
You live here by yourself?

51:14.070 --> 51:16.031
Mr. Lee sure must be busy.

51:16.114 --> 51:17.407
You can take a shower here.

51:33.256 --> 51:34.716
Soo-ho!

51:35.926 --> 51:40.013
- Are you all right?
- I think I sprained my back. I can't move.

51:40.096 --> 51:41.014
Help me up, please.

51:48.730 --> 51:50.941
You can sleep here.
I'll sleep on the couch.

51:51.817 --> 51:53.109
I can't possibly do that.

51:53.193 --> 51:55.278
I can't be so brazen
to my daughter's friend.

51:55.362 --> 51:57.113
I'll sleep outside,

51:57.197 --> 52:00.826
so don't mind me,
and sleep here in comfort.

52:00.909 --> 52:02.118
Good night then.

52:02.744 --> 52:04.663
Soo-ho, thank you.

52:05.330 --> 52:06.790
Thank you, Soo-ho.

52:08.542 --> 52:11.837
The house looks seriously terrible
without Dad.

52:12.379 --> 52:15.799
Hey, why don't you clean my room
while you're at it?

52:15.882 --> 52:18.134
- Then I should start with you.
- That's disgusting!

52:18.218 --> 52:19.845
There you go again!

52:20.971 --> 52:23.807
I'll do the cleaning.
Leave it and come have some apples.

52:23.890 --> 52:26.351
It's fine.
You must be tired after working all day.

52:26.434 --> 52:27.561
I'm almost done.

52:28.186 --> 52:33.400
- Like a lone flower blossoming
- Like a lone flower blossoming

52:34.276 --> 52:37.529
In a wide open field

52:37.612 --> 52:44.411
I've protected the feeling of emptiness

52:44.494 --> 52:46.329
Inside my heart

52:46.413 --> 52:51.042
Like the sun coming out

52:51.126 --> 52:56.006
- After heavy rain…
- …I've protected

52:56.631 --> 52:58.800
- The feeling of emptiness…
- Hey!

52:59.759 --> 53:01.052
Don't you sing that song.

53:01.136 --> 53:02.429
- Don't sing it!
- What?

53:05.682 --> 53:06.933
What's up with him?

53:07.559 --> 53:11.021
Anyway, I wonder if your dad
is at least eating some food.

53:11.104 --> 53:13.857
He's probably eating well
and sleeping well.

53:22.449 --> 53:23.325
Mr. Lim?

53:23.408 --> 53:24.951
Gosh, you startled me.

53:25.035 --> 53:26.995
Did I wake you? I'm sorry.

53:27.078 --> 53:29.497
What are you doing up this early?

53:30.498 --> 53:32.292
Son Heung-min's playing, you see…

53:33.418 --> 53:35.128
Right, I'd set an alarm for it.

53:36.588 --> 53:37.756
You're his fan, then.

53:37.839 --> 53:39.758
Shall we watch the second half together?

53:39.841 --> 53:41.134
Mr. Lim.

53:41.885 --> 53:43.762
After watching the first half highlights.

53:49.893 --> 53:50.810
Looks good.

53:54.230 --> 53:55.398
Here, have some.

53:56.858 --> 53:58.026
I don't eat at this hour.

53:58.109 --> 54:00.236
It's not the same with a game going on.

54:00.320 --> 54:02.364
You'll regret it if you don't. Come on.

54:03.698 --> 54:04.616
I'll eat it myself.

54:05.367 --> 54:06.284
Okay then.

54:07.911 --> 54:10.538
- You have no idea how good it is.
- He's just like Ju-kyung.

54:11.039 --> 54:12.374
It looks so good.

54:14.459 --> 54:15.460
It's so hot!

54:16.503 --> 54:17.379
Hot!

54:18.088 --> 54:19.464
- I burned my tongue.
- Here.

54:20.465 --> 54:21.967
You should have slowed down.

54:23.301 --> 54:25.804
You're quite sweet, Soo-ho.

54:25.887 --> 54:26.763
The second half starts

54:26.846 --> 54:28.765
- with Son Heung-min's kick-off!
- Son Heung-min!

54:29.683 --> 54:32.644
Which team will advance to the final?

54:32.727 --> 54:34.229
Yes. As we speak,

54:34.312 --> 54:36.815
he quickly goes to score an equalizer
as the second half starts.

54:36.898 --> 54:38.358
He crosses the ball early!

54:38.441 --> 54:39.985
It falls short.

54:40.068 --> 54:41.611
Son Heung-min gets it right away!

54:41.695 --> 54:45.115
He doesn't hesitate
and uses his right foot. Shoot, goal!

54:45.198 --> 54:49.995
Son Heung-min scores
just two minutes into the second half.

55:52.891 --> 55:53.933
Soo-ho!

55:54.434 --> 55:55.268
Soo-ho.

55:55.769 --> 55:57.520
You barely had your breakfast.

55:57.604 --> 55:58.855
Have this on the way.

55:58.938 --> 56:01.357
Go enjoy your classes and come home later.

56:01.983 --> 56:04.319
That's not it.
I'll have gone home by then.

56:05.236 --> 56:06.362
Thanks for everything.

56:06.446 --> 56:07.781
You're going home now, right?

56:08.281 --> 56:09.699
I'll keep your secret just for today--

56:09.783 --> 56:12.035
Okay. I'll be off
as soon as I finish the dishes.

56:12.118 --> 56:14.704
I just need to be prepared mentally.

56:14.788 --> 56:16.706
To get scolded by my wife.

56:21.461 --> 56:23.546
He's so young but is so mature.

56:24.631 --> 56:26.966
Is it because he had to grow up
without his mom?

56:27.050 --> 56:28.051
Watch out for cars!

56:31.429 --> 56:32.555
- Have fun at school!
- I'm off.

56:35.558 --> 56:36.559
Let's go.

56:36.643 --> 56:38.728
What are they teaching you
in P.E. class today?

56:38.812 --> 56:40.480
- Soccer.
- Is that so?

56:40.563 --> 56:41.648
That'll be fun.

57:06.256 --> 57:08.341
What's wrong? Are you lost?

57:08.424 --> 57:09.467
What?

57:09.551 --> 57:12.095
Why do you continue
to roam around in my thoughts?

57:13.721 --> 57:14.681
All right.

57:14.764 --> 57:17.183
I'll give you a chance
to remain in my thoughts.

57:20.520 --> 57:21.771
Well…

57:22.564 --> 57:24.399
Go out with me.

57:27.652 --> 57:28.570
Why?

57:28.653 --> 57:31.364
Are you so overwhelmed
that you can't speak?

57:34.868 --> 57:35.910
Really not funny.

57:38.163 --> 57:39.205
"Really not funny"?

57:39.289 --> 57:40.123
Here.

57:40.206 --> 57:43.126
I used to work at this cafe,
and they're hiring a part-timer.

57:43.209 --> 57:45.503
I already told them about you,
so visit them later.

57:45.587 --> 57:46.421
Gosh.

57:46.504 --> 57:48.798
Amazing. In one day?

57:48.882 --> 57:51.676
Hey, thank you so much.
You're well-connected.

57:52.343 --> 57:54.179
Great job! Excellent!

57:55.054 --> 57:57.599
You're really great. Thank you.

57:57.682 --> 57:59.267
- Ju-kyung.
- What?

58:04.230 --> 58:05.231
Let's go.

58:17.660 --> 58:19.996
Try to memorize the menu
as soon as possible.

58:20.079 --> 58:22.499
Drink recipes are all posted here,

58:22.582 --> 58:25.543
but until you learn them,
you'll take orders and do the dishes.

58:25.627 --> 58:26.669
Got it.

58:26.753 --> 58:27.921
Welcome.

58:28.004 --> 58:29.631
I haven't cleaned the cups yet.

58:30.131 --> 58:32.675
- Can you please wash the cups first?
- Yes, of course.

58:33.343 --> 58:34.594
Hi, what can I get you?

58:56.658 --> 58:57.951
Oh, no, are you okay?

58:58.618 --> 59:01.037
- I'm okay.
- Goodness.

59:01.621 --> 59:03.456
These will be uploaded to the website.

59:03.540 --> 59:04.749
They came out well, right?

59:04.832 --> 59:06.626
JEONG-HUN

59:17.679 --> 59:19.013
Why would he send me these?

59:19.847 --> 59:21.057
He could've sent just a few.

59:22.350 --> 59:23.518
WILL YOU DELETE THIS IMAGE?
DELETE

59:24.227 --> 59:29.065
WILL YOU DELETE THIS IMAGE?
CANCEL, DELETE

59:30.567 --> 59:32.110
CAFE OWNER

59:33.194 --> 59:34.320
Yes, ma'am?

59:35.655 --> 59:37.240
You decided to hire Ju-kyung?

59:37.907 --> 59:38.992
Yes.

59:39.075 --> 59:41.160
Thanks for introducing her.

59:41.244 --> 59:43.705
Ju-kyung is here right now
getting trained.

59:45.290 --> 59:47.584
Goodness. Did you get hurt, Ju-kyung?

59:48.543 --> 59:50.128
What? She got hurt?

59:50.211 --> 59:52.422
It barely touched me.

59:52.505 --> 59:53.756
I'm all right. Really.

59:58.511 --> 59:59.387
Ju-kyung.

01:00:03.308 --> 01:00:04.350
Thank you.

01:00:06.561 --> 01:00:07.478
Seo-jun!

01:00:07.562 --> 01:00:08.855
Where's Ju-kyung?

01:00:09.355 --> 01:00:10.440
She left a bit ago.

01:00:10.523 --> 01:00:12.859
- Excuse me?
- Did you run here?

01:00:14.569 --> 01:00:15.612
Have I gone mad?

01:00:16.821 --> 01:00:18.239
Why did I run here?

01:00:20.074 --> 01:00:21.993
Hey, where did you get the eyelash curler?

01:00:26.039 --> 01:00:28.416
What's with that rude punk?
He didn't even apologize.

01:00:28.958 --> 01:00:29.792
Are you all right?

01:00:38.051 --> 01:00:39.385
Han Seo-jun?

01:00:46.643 --> 01:00:49.270
I guess Hee-kyung is not here yet.
What about Ju-young?

01:00:49.354 --> 01:00:51.022
Ju-young? He went to his math tutor.

01:00:51.898 --> 01:00:53.858
What? He got a tutor?

01:00:54.525 --> 01:00:57.070
He wanted to get better at math
so I got him a tutor.

01:00:57.153 --> 01:00:58.780
You always say we don't have money.

01:01:00.073 --> 01:01:02.325
You said you had no customers
and that things are rough.

01:01:02.408 --> 01:01:05.328
Even if I have no money,
I need to provide for my kids.

01:01:06.037 --> 01:01:08.164
If you want a math tutor, tell me.

01:01:08.247 --> 01:01:10.249
I'll get you one
even if I have to take out a loan.

01:01:11.292 --> 01:01:12.877
Then give me 1.5 million won.

01:01:14.170 --> 01:01:15.088
1.5 million?

01:01:15.171 --> 01:01:16.464
Whatever.

01:01:17.674 --> 01:01:19.342
I'm the only one thinking about you.

01:01:19.425 --> 01:01:21.594
I'm not doing this anymore.
Have Ju-young do it.

01:01:21.678 --> 01:01:23.346
Ju-kyung, where are you going?

01:01:27.475 --> 01:01:30.019
Hey, how was your first day?

01:01:30.103 --> 01:01:31.979
I was a mess.

01:01:33.231 --> 01:01:35.775
I'll learn things
and do better moving forward.

01:01:35.858 --> 01:01:37.568
Why do you sound so down?

01:01:38.319 --> 01:01:39.278
Are you outside?

01:01:39.362 --> 01:01:40.196
Yes.

01:01:41.197 --> 01:01:42.907
I came out to clear my head.

01:01:43.449 --> 01:01:45.034
Do you want to come here?

01:01:48.121 --> 01:01:50.581
I feel better after exercise.

01:01:50.665 --> 01:01:52.875
You do? So how do I do it?

01:01:53.459 --> 01:01:54.377
Grab me by my collar.

01:01:56.045 --> 01:01:58.131
I'll grab the sleeve here, and then here.

01:01:58.840 --> 01:02:00.091
Step in.

01:02:00.675 --> 01:02:01.634
Hey.

01:02:02.385 --> 01:02:03.553
Hey.

01:02:05.638 --> 01:02:06.639
Grabbing it.

01:02:11.811 --> 01:02:12.729
Great job.

01:02:12.812 --> 01:02:14.981
Now flip me over
using what you just learned.

01:02:15.064 --> 01:02:16.441
How can I possibly flip you over?

01:02:16.524 --> 01:02:18.401
If you succeed, I'll grant you a wish.

01:02:19.235 --> 01:02:20.903
Really? You're not lying?

01:02:20.987 --> 01:02:22.780
- Why would I lie to you?
- All right.

01:02:48.347 --> 01:02:49.515
You come here!

01:02:53.436 --> 01:02:55.146
Yay, I did it!

01:02:55.229 --> 01:02:56.355
Wasn't that cheating?

01:02:56.439 --> 01:02:58.483
I just learned.
You need to cut me some slack.

01:02:58.566 --> 01:02:59.400
All right.

01:03:00.026 --> 01:03:00.860
What's your wish?

01:03:00.943 --> 01:03:01.778
My wish?

01:03:04.280 --> 01:03:06.157
You can ask me to pay
for the beauty school course.

01:03:06.240 --> 01:03:08.618
What? It's super expensive.

01:03:08.701 --> 01:03:09.660
Even if it is.

01:03:10.244 --> 01:03:11.829
Are you showing off that you're rich?

01:03:11.913 --> 01:03:14.832
- Come on, tell me.
- Someone's watched some stuff.

01:03:14.916 --> 01:03:16.125
No, thank you.

01:03:19.003 --> 01:03:20.129
I got one.

01:03:20.838 --> 01:03:21.672
What is it?

01:03:23.174 --> 01:03:24.008
Well…

01:03:25.718 --> 01:03:27.929
It's a bit embarrassing.

01:03:39.857 --> 01:03:41.776
You know what? Never mind.

01:03:41.859 --> 01:03:43.069
I'll go get changed.

01:04:02.672 --> 01:04:05.383
LEE SOO-HO

01:04:10.054 --> 01:04:12.431
The person you are trying to reach
is unavailable…

01:04:18.396 --> 01:04:19.522
Why did you text…

01:04:21.774 --> 01:04:22.900
BOYFRIEND

01:04:23.651 --> 01:04:25.611
GIRLFRIEND

01:04:28.781 --> 01:04:30.283
On my phone,

01:04:30.366 --> 01:04:32.910
I saved your number as "Boyfriend."

01:04:43.880 --> 01:04:45.172
It must have sprinkled.

01:04:46.465 --> 01:04:47.425
It must have.

01:04:47.508 --> 01:04:50.553
We don't have an umbrella.
We could have gotten soaked.

01:04:51.220 --> 01:04:52.388
Lucky us, I guess.

01:05:07.528 --> 01:05:09.947
- Are you all right?
- That was some bad luck.

01:05:29.550 --> 01:05:30.426
What are you doing?

01:05:31.093 --> 01:05:31.928
Sorry?

01:05:32.511 --> 01:05:33.429
Aren't you coming up?

01:05:34.430 --> 01:05:35.264
I'm coming.

01:05:48.194 --> 01:05:50.613
Wait here. I'll get you some clothes.

01:05:51.364 --> 01:05:52.323
Okay.

01:06:06.545 --> 01:06:07.880
- Want to eat food?
- We could watch TV…

01:06:08.923 --> 01:06:10.007
- Want to watch TV?
- Let's eat.

01:06:11.258 --> 01:06:13.552
Let's eat.
You haven't had dinner yet, right?

01:06:13.636 --> 01:06:14.929
I can make you…

01:06:15.554 --> 01:06:16.973
Or should we just get delivery?

01:06:17.056 --> 01:06:17.890
Sure.

01:06:18.432 --> 01:06:19.976
I'm good with anything.

01:06:20.059 --> 01:06:21.811
- Is pizza okay?
- Yes.

01:06:47.795 --> 01:06:48.921
What is it?

01:06:49.422 --> 01:06:51.048
Hey, what is this room?

01:06:51.716 --> 01:06:54.176
- What?
- It's just locked so well.

01:06:54.260 --> 01:06:56.053
Did you hide something weird in there?

01:06:56.137 --> 01:06:57.179
It's not like that.

01:06:57.263 --> 01:06:59.515
Are there some corpses inside
like in the movies?

01:07:04.603 --> 01:07:05.604
Do you want to see it?

01:07:06.188 --> 01:07:07.898
The passcode has been verified.

01:07:18.993 --> 01:07:20.619
Are you a musician then?

01:07:22.163 --> 01:07:23.664
I wanted to be one before.

01:07:24.582 --> 01:07:25.750
What about now?

01:07:28.169 --> 01:07:29.879
After what happened to Se-yeon,

01:07:31.047 --> 01:07:31.881
I just couldn't.

01:07:33.215 --> 01:07:34.133
It was Se-yeon…

01:07:34.925 --> 01:07:36.427
who taught me how to write music.

01:07:41.932 --> 01:07:43.267
It was hard to look at,

01:07:44.351 --> 01:07:45.811
so I rarely came into this room.

01:07:46.645 --> 01:07:47.480
I'm sorry.

01:07:48.230 --> 01:07:49.148
I shouldn't have…

01:07:49.899 --> 01:07:51.067
But it feels okay.

01:07:53.110 --> 01:07:54.612
Maybe because you're with me.

01:07:58.365 --> 01:08:01.160
Should we tell people that we go out?

01:08:01.243 --> 01:08:03.621
Why all of a sudden?
You wanted to keep it a secret.

01:08:03.704 --> 01:08:07.166
I feel like I pushed things my way
without even asking your opinion.

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:10.461
- What if you get dragged to the rooftop?
- Guess I'll let them.

01:08:11.921 --> 01:08:13.297
I don't care either way.

01:08:13.881 --> 01:08:17.051
It doesn't change the fact
that you're my girlfriend.

01:08:22.306 --> 01:08:24.391
The song you played me before,

01:08:25.267 --> 01:08:26.894
the unreleased song.

01:08:28.312 --> 01:08:29.647
Did you write it?

01:08:30.731 --> 01:08:31.565
Yes.

01:08:32.775 --> 01:08:33.776
The lyrics were…

01:08:36.320 --> 01:08:37.488
written by Se-yeon.

01:08:38.489 --> 01:08:39.532
I see.

01:08:41.075 --> 01:08:42.868
The song was really good.

01:08:49.125 --> 01:08:50.584
Do you want me to play it?

01:08:51.335 --> 01:08:52.211
Yes.

01:08:55.840 --> 01:08:58.425
I quit playing the piano
while learning the first volume of Beyer.

01:08:58.509 --> 01:09:00.177
I haven't played in a while either,

01:09:01.345 --> 01:09:02.972
so don't hold your breath.

01:09:28.914 --> 01:09:30.749
That noise was from outside.

01:09:39.133 --> 01:09:41.385
Is it going to rain?
I can hear the thunder.

01:09:41.468 --> 01:09:42.636
I wonder what's going on.

01:09:52.354 --> 01:09:54.565
This piano sounds amazing.
It's expensive, right?

01:10:01.530 --> 01:10:02.740
I'll go get it right away.

01:10:04.491 --> 01:10:05.326
Wait.

01:10:09.914 --> 01:10:12.583
Jeez, for crying out loud!

01:10:13.292 --> 01:10:14.710
Thank you. Enjoy!

01:10:14.793 --> 01:10:16.212
- Thank you.
- Goodbye.

01:10:32.770 --> 01:10:35.064
I thought I might clean the place for him,

01:10:35.773 --> 01:10:37.524
but it's spotless.

01:10:37.608 --> 01:10:38.901
There's nothing to…

01:10:41.487 --> 01:10:44.365
What's this liquor bottle doing here
at a young student's place?

01:10:45.282 --> 01:10:46.992
Gosh, this is expensive stuff.

01:10:53.290 --> 01:10:54.792
It might have gone bad.

01:10:54.875 --> 01:10:56.794
Trying it is the only way to know.

01:10:58.128 --> 01:11:00.714
Soo-ho, I'll just have a taste, okay?

01:11:01.882 --> 01:11:02.800
Just a pinch.

01:11:45.426 --> 01:11:47.052
Want to watch a movie while we eat?

01:11:47.678 --> 01:11:48.554
Sure.

01:11:52.224 --> 01:11:53.767
It smells good.

01:11:53.851 --> 01:11:54.893
What should we watch?

01:11:55.477 --> 01:11:56.312
Well,

01:11:56.395 --> 01:11:57.688
how about a horror movie?

01:11:58.564 --> 01:11:59.940
We could watch something else.

01:12:00.024 --> 01:12:01.525
Why? You can't watch scary stuff?

01:12:02.693 --> 01:12:06.071
It rained and all, so maybe we can
watch a musical or something.

01:12:06.155 --> 01:12:09.241
What? You, the horror comic nerd,
can't watch horror movies?

01:12:09.325 --> 01:12:11.410
I already read them as comics every day,

01:12:11.493 --> 01:12:13.495
so no need to watch them as movies, right?

01:12:13.579 --> 01:12:16.081
It'll be okay.
I'll cover your eyes if you get scared.

01:12:16.165 --> 01:12:17.666
I'm not that much of a wimp, okay?

01:12:17.750 --> 01:12:19.918
Turn off the lights.
Lights off for horror movies.

01:12:20.002 --> 01:12:21.295
There are other interesting…

01:12:21.378 --> 01:12:25.632
I'm being such a nuisance
when he's on a date with his girlfriend.

01:12:31.013 --> 01:12:32.514
- Here.
- Okay.

01:13:07.841 --> 01:13:09.885
Soo-ho is a man, indeed.

01:13:17.851 --> 01:13:20.020
You really haven't seen horror films,
have you?

01:13:20.104 --> 01:13:22.272
Ghosts don't come out
in these kinds of scenes.

01:13:31.782 --> 01:13:33.117
You said they don't come out.

01:14:29.965 --> 01:14:31.049
Dad?

01:15:12.466 --> 01:15:14.218
- I miss you.
- Me too.

01:15:15.093 --> 01:15:18.222
Since when did you start going out?
Why didn't you tell me?

01:15:18.305 --> 01:15:19.681
Me and Han Seo-jun?

01:15:19.765 --> 01:15:21.141
By the way, Ju-kyung,

01:15:21.225 --> 01:15:23.185
should I tell him how I feel
when I give him this?

01:15:24.228 --> 01:15:27.231
Have you ever liked the same girl
as your best friend?

01:15:27.314 --> 01:15:28.148
No!

01:15:28.649 --> 01:15:29.775
Why are you two coming in together?

01:15:30.359 --> 01:15:34.613
Don't people usually show their boyfriends
old photo albums when they come over?

01:15:35.531 --> 01:15:37.199
I don't like you two talking,

01:15:37.282 --> 01:15:39.076
much less locking eyes.

01:15:39.159 --> 01:15:41.078
- Then we can't see each other?
- Lee Soo-ho!

01:15:42.371 --> 01:15:47.042
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
